1
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:53,920
You're a real beauty, miss.

2
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,401
This jade hairpin suits you perfectly.

3
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,720
Why not try it on?

4
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,321
You don't look like a local.

5
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:14,280
What's your name?

6
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:16,080
Shen Zhishu.

7
00:02:16,201 --> 00:02:17,400
I'm here looking for a friend.

8
00:02:17,561 --> 00:02:19,360
What friend? What does he or she look like?

9
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,201
I can help.

10
00:02:21,161 --> 00:02:22,041
A young gentleman.

11
00:02:22,041 --> 00:02:23,120
Jingdu accent.

12
00:02:23,201 --> 00:02:24,120
Not quite

13
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,400
as handsome

14
00:02:25,721 --> 00:02:27,481
or refined as me,

15
00:02:27,721 --> 00:02:28,721
and

16
00:02:29,161 --> 00:02:30,800
a little shorter.

17
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,001
Mr. Shen?

18
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,001
Huang?

19
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,161
Finally found you!

20
00:02:38,761 --> 00:02:40,201
From Jingdu to Shazhou,

21
00:02:40,481 --> 00:02:41,680
you still made time for fun.

22
00:02:45,321 --> 00:02:46,201
Huang,

23
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,721
this trip's been the death of me.

24
00:02:48,201 --> 00:02:49,601
I crossed mountains and rivers.

25
00:02:49,601 --> 00:02:51,481
I even slept in the open.

26
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:52,161
I...

27
00:02:53,481 --> 00:02:55,201
Finally spotted a pretty face?

28
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:57,561
What are you doing here?

29
00:02:57,721 --> 00:02:59,281
Master figured you'd arrive about now

30
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,520
and sent me to wait here.

31
00:03:00,761 --> 00:03:01,601
Hold on a sec.

32
00:03:05,761 --> 00:03:06,881
Where did the beauty go?

33
00:03:39,601 --> 00:03:40,240
Don't tell me

34
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:42,240
you broke out of prison.

35
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,400
No ordinary

36
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:44,881
dungeon could hold me.

37
00:03:44,881 --> 00:03:46,520
The Ding family is searching for you.

38
00:03:46,721 --> 00:03:47,561
They want you dead,

39
00:03:48,041 --> 00:03:49,201
yet you dare show up here.

40
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,721
What do you want?

41
00:03:56,041 --> 00:03:57,481
I'm here to get you out of this jam.

42
00:04:04,041 --> 00:04:04,680
You?

43
00:04:05,441 --> 00:04:06,321
How?

44
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,360
Nethereach

45
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,601
is Black Tiger's turf.

46
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:11,080
I know you're investigating illegal arms sales

47
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,761
and posing as a rich merchant from North Jian

48
00:04:12,761 --> 00:04:13,640
to get close to Ding Chong.

49
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,520
You're here

50
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:17,281
for proof that officials

51
00:04:17,281 --> 00:04:18,441
and the gang

52
00:04:18,441 --> 00:04:19,800
are colluding in the arms trade.

53
00:04:20,321 --> 00:04:21,161
I

54
00:04:21,561 --> 00:04:23,080
grew up in Shazhou

55
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,840
and know this place inside out.

56
00:04:24,921 --> 00:04:26,761
I already know all that.

57
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:29,160
You're no use to me.

58
00:04:29,280 --> 00:04:30,241
You're

59
00:04:30,361 --> 00:04:31,280
a fugitive now,

60
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,321
barred from the imperial exams.

61
00:04:32,561 --> 00:04:35,280
You're the one who needs a favor.

62
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:42,321
Mr. Hal,

63
00:04:42,921 --> 00:04:45,121
I misjudged you before.

64
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:47,640
Now that I'm a fugitive,

65
00:04:48,201 --> 00:04:49,241
I can't sit the imperial exams.

66
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,241
Whether I pass is one thing,

67
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:52,801
but I can't

68
00:04:52,801 --> 00:04:54,280
lose the right to even try.

69
00:04:54,561 --> 00:04:55,921
You're here to investigate a case.

70
00:04:56,441 --> 00:04:57,720
I trust you're an honest official.

71
00:04:58,361 --> 00:04:59,561
You need a guide,

72
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:01,040
and I need a way out.

73
00:05:01,881 --> 00:05:03,400
We each get what we need.

74
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:04,681
We can both

75
00:05:04,681 --> 00:05:06,080
rid Shazhou of criminal gangs

76
00:05:06,441 --> 00:05:07,280
and clear

77
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,160
my name.

78
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,881
Fair point, Ms. Meng,

79
00:05:11,441 --> 00:05:13,121
but I can't take you inside.

80
00:05:13,561 --> 00:05:14,881
I only have one pass,

81
00:05:15,201 --> 00:05:16,520
and I paid Ding Chong

82
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:17,600
a fortune for it.

83
00:05:17,681 --> 00:05:18,441
What a coincidence.

84
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,761
I have one too.

85
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,280
Ms. Meng,

86
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:30,201
you make stealing look easy.

87
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:31,921
You started

88
00:05:31,921 --> 00:05:33,160
thieving as a kid?

89
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:35,921
Just a way to make a living.

90
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,761
If you can forge one,

91
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,400
why steal mine?

92
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:54,681
Nethereach's market opens every seven days.

93
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,480
To prevent forgeries,

94
00:05:56,801 --> 00:05:58,681
they put a different hidden symbol

95
00:05:59,001 --> 00:06:00,801
on each pass every time.

96
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:13,600
You're full of surprises, Ms. Meng.

97
00:06:17,121 --> 00:06:18,600
Since you're skilled in martial arts,

98
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,960
I'll keep

99
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:23,241
the real one.

100
00:06:27,121 --> 00:06:28,400
You gave me the fake one

101
00:06:29,001 --> 00:06:30,280
while keeping a way out

102
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:31,160
for yourself?

103
00:06:39,241 --> 00:06:40,080
It's time.

104
00:06:40,921 --> 00:06:41,720
Let's go.

105
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:45,480
To get by in Shazhou, one

106
00:06:45,761 --> 00:06:46,881
has to be Black Tiger Gang's lackey.

107
00:06:47,761 --> 00:06:49,160
There's no justice here.

108
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:51,361
Crimes like murder are routine.

109
00:06:52,001 --> 00:06:52,561
Those were merchants

110
00:06:52,561 --> 00:06:54,160
who couldn't afford the protection fees.

111
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:56,441
See that green glow in the skull?

112
00:06:57,080 --> 00:06:58,441
Black Tiger uses skulls

113
00:06:58,441 --> 00:06:59,361
as eternal lamps.

114
00:06:59,921 --> 00:07:00,960
The more resentment the dead harbor,

115
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:01,921
Move it back there!

116
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:03,201
the brighter it burns.

117
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:05,160
You dare fool me

118
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,520
with a pass from seven days ago?

119
00:07:14,881 --> 00:07:15,520
Move along.

120
00:07:19,561 --> 00:07:20,160
Next.

121
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:39,160
Go on in.

122
00:07:43,801 --> 00:07:44,321
Go in.

123
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:56,520
Come on, everyone!

124
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:58,280
Trade licenses for sale!

125
00:07:58,640 --> 00:07:59,921
They'll be gone soon!

126
00:08:00,241 --> 00:08:00,881
Come on!

127
00:08:00,921 --> 00:08:01,681
Hurry!

128
00:08:03,561 --> 00:08:04,241
Trade licenses

129
00:08:04,241 --> 00:08:05,561
are issued by the court.

130
00:08:05,681 --> 00:08:07,441
The prefectures verify and register them.

131
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:09,280
They're normally granted only to established,

132
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:10,681
reputable merchants.

133
00:08:11,681 --> 00:08:13,080
How could they possibly be sold here?

134
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:16,001
They openly sell

135
00:08:16,001 --> 00:08:17,520
even salt and iron,

136
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:19,040
goods the court's outright banned,

137
00:08:19,561 --> 00:08:20,960
let alone trade licenses.

138
00:08:21,681 --> 00:08:23,080
Ding Chong is insatiably greedy.

139
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:24,640
He auctions them off for up to

140
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:25,840
a thousand taels of gold apiece.

141
00:08:26,881 --> 00:08:28,321
The Yan family crossed him once

142
00:08:28,321 --> 00:08:29,960
and had their license held for half a year.

143
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:31,321
They had to

144
00:08:31,321 --> 00:08:32,280
hand over two chests of gold

145
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,480
just to get it back.

146
00:08:33,881 --> 00:08:35,280
The court opened border trade

147
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:36,720
to benefit the people.

148
00:08:37,121 --> 00:08:38,600
Yet parasites like him

149
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:39,561
profit off it.

150
00:08:57,860 --> 00:08:58,960
Look, the quality's solid.

151
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,960
The price is a bit steep, though.

152
00:09:04,321 --> 00:09:05,561
You won't find salt this good anywhere else.

153
00:09:06,321 --> 00:09:07,120
It's the real deal.

154
00:09:08,801 --> 00:09:09,600
Come take a look.

155
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:11,561
Top quality.

156
00:09:17,521 --> 00:09:19,281
How come no one's selling arms?

157
00:09:21,041 --> 00:09:22,161
The arms trade involves the garrison,

158
00:09:22,161 --> 00:09:23,201
so it is no small matter.

159
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,281
Even Ding Chong

160
00:09:24,281 --> 00:09:25,561
wouldn't dare sell them openly.

161
00:09:25,921 --> 00:09:27,561
Whoever's backing him inside the army

162
00:09:27,561 --> 00:09:29,080
must be even more careful.

163
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,641
Mr. Hal,

164
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,641
what would you do without

165
00:09:35,161 --> 00:09:36,441
a guide like me?

166
00:09:36,441 --> 00:09:37,960
I have my own ways.

167
00:09:39,441 --> 00:09:40,240
But you look

168
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:41,641
so confident.

169
00:09:41,801 --> 00:09:42,880
Let's see what you've

170
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,720
got planned.

171
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:45,720
Follow me.

172
00:09:58,041 --> 00:09:59,161
Walking at night with a lantern in hand,

173
00:09:59,441 --> 00:10:02,281
is your path bright, dark, or dim?

174
00:10:04,321 --> 00:10:05,561
The mist is too thick to tell.

175
00:10:06,161 --> 00:10:07,561
Just follow the others,

176
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,161
and everything'll be fine.

177
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:12,760
Ms. Meng,

178
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,921
the man you brought this time

179
00:10:15,921 --> 00:10:17,760
is far better than those good-for-nothings

180
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:18,720
before.

181
00:10:22,201 --> 00:10:23,480
His face looks sour, though.

182
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:24,441
You'd think

183
00:10:24,441 --> 00:10:26,240
he's here to collect a debt.

184
00:10:27,561 --> 00:10:28,921
Not just his face.

185
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:30,600
His temper is awful too.

186
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,521
Arrogant,

187
00:10:33,041 --> 00:10:34,281
conceited,

188
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:35,921
and full of himself.

189
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,120
Sir,

190
00:10:40,921 --> 00:10:42,201
what information are you after?

191
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:44,281
In all of Shazhou,

192
00:10:44,441 --> 00:10:45,480
there's nothing

193
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,360
I don't know.

194
00:10:49,281 --> 00:10:51,120
I wanna buy arms from Black Tiger.

195
00:10:51,281 --> 00:10:52,880
Who do I go through?

196
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,921
[He even traced the arms]

197
00:10:55,921 --> 00:10:56,801
[to Black Tiger Gang.]

198
00:11:00,681 --> 00:11:02,041
Trading arms

199
00:11:04,201 --> 00:11:05,720
is a capital crime.

200
00:11:18,321 --> 00:11:18,960
Never mind.

201
00:11:19,681 --> 00:11:21,041
I'll ask around elsewhere.

202
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:23,960
Wait. Why so

203
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:25,000
impatient?

204
00:11:25,161 --> 00:11:26,441
I'll point you two

205
00:11:26,441 --> 00:11:27,240
to a way in.

206
00:11:35,880 --> 00:11:36,840
Guess

207
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:38,641
everyone has a price.

208
00:11:39,201 --> 00:11:39,720
More like

209
00:11:39,720 --> 00:11:41,720
you can't beat gangsters on their own turf.

210
00:11:42,201 --> 00:11:43,120
Without me,

211
00:11:43,561 --> 00:11:44,681
who knows what you'd...

212
00:11:45,561 --> 00:11:46,201
We're here.

213
00:11:55,521 --> 00:11:57,240
Master Feng's given orders.

214
00:11:57,801 --> 00:11:58,921
If you've come

215
00:11:58,921 --> 00:12:00,480
for real business,

216
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:02,161
you're our honored guest.

217
00:12:02,321 --> 00:12:03,801
If you act suspiciously

218
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:05,201
or have ulterior motives,

219
00:12:06,521 --> 00:12:07,921
you get killed on the spot.

220
00:12:17,760 --> 00:12:19,641
Are you alright?

221
00:12:38,201 --> 00:12:39,480
Are you hurt?

222
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,880
Ms. Meng, what a fine guide you found.

223
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:44,760
Leading us

224
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:46,080
straight into a dead end.

225
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:47,641
Stop being sarcastic.

226
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:50,080
This is on you.

227
00:12:50,161 --> 00:12:52,161
You mentioned buying arms and blew our cover.

228
00:13:14,041 --> 00:13:15,401
This cave is sealed.

229
00:13:18,401 --> 00:13:18,880
Are we

230
00:13:18,880 --> 00:13:20,201
gonna die in here?

231
00:13:20,521 --> 00:13:21,840
Since I brought you in,

232
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:23,600
I won't let anything happen to you.

233
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:26,960
What's that sound?

234
00:13:41,561 --> 00:13:42,161
Careful.

235
00:13:43,921 --> 00:13:45,401
That golden krait is highly venomous.

236
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,161
A master like you,

237
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,561
scared of a little snake?

238
00:13:58,600 --> 00:13:59,641
Who's scared?

239
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:02,321
It's the venom I'm worried about.

240
00:14:02,561 --> 00:14:03,561
Well, I'm not.

241
00:14:29,041 --> 00:14:29,760
Another trick

242
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:31,201
up your sleeve?

243
00:14:32,401 --> 00:14:34,120
You promised to keep me safe.

244
00:14:37,321 --> 00:14:38,521
The rest is up to you.

245
00:15:02,281 --> 00:15:03,201
Phosphor powder is running out.

246
00:15:04,281 --> 00:15:05,000
The talisman paper!

247
00:15:34,401 --> 00:15:34,960
Go!

248
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:42,521
I felt air.

249
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:09,720
Cheers!

250
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:10,840
Cheers!

251
00:16:17,401 --> 00:16:19,321
Luckily, Ding was one move ahead.

252
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:20,720
That guy

253
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:21,720
tried to play the rich merchant

254
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:23,240
and snoop around?

255
00:16:23,880 --> 00:16:25,760
He's got a death wish.

256
00:16:25,760 --> 00:16:26,561
Exactly.

257
00:16:26,720 --> 00:16:28,600
He really thought he was smart?

258
00:16:28,760 --> 00:16:29,801
Prefect Ding

259
00:16:29,880 --> 00:16:31,321
had already dug up

260
00:16:31,321 --> 00:16:32,561
everything on them.

261
00:16:32,561 --> 00:16:33,521
Those two

262
00:16:34,281 --> 00:16:36,080
are probably dead by now.

263
00:16:36,201 --> 00:16:37,760
That's for sure.

264
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:40,041
Nobody's ever walked out

265
00:16:40,041 --> 00:16:41,201
of that pit alive.

266
00:16:42,201 --> 00:16:43,801
No one crosses

267
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:46,201
the Black Tiger and walks away.

268
00:16:46,521 --> 00:16:47,360
Guys!

269
00:16:47,521 --> 00:16:48,161
The snake pit

270
00:16:48,161 --> 00:16:50,080
connects to Black Tiger Hall.

271
00:16:50,441 --> 00:16:51,080
Saves us

272
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:52,360
the trouble.

273
00:16:53,401 --> 00:16:54,441
That scarred man is Feng Lu,

274
00:16:54,561 --> 00:16:56,161
head of the Black Tiger.

275
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:58,441
We're outnumbered.

276
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:00,600
We'll have to play this smart.

277
00:17:00,641 --> 00:17:02,120
Let's take out the leader first.

278
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:07,880
Everyone,

279
00:17:08,521 --> 00:17:09,600
drink up!

280
00:17:10,120 --> 00:17:11,881
Cheers.

281
00:17:36,601 --> 00:17:38,361
Is there a fire?

282
00:17:57,601 --> 00:17:58,240
Master!

283
00:17:59,280 --> 00:18:00,881
I think I see him.

284
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:01,641
Who?

285
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:04,201
Who's it?

286
00:18:04,201 --> 00:18:04,760
Don't move.

287
00:18:06,881 --> 00:18:07,441
Master!

288
00:18:09,921 --> 00:18:11,320
One step closer,

289
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:12,681
and we'll kill him.

290
00:18:15,081 --> 00:18:15,720
Listen,

291
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:18,121
I know you're looking into the arms trade,

292
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:21,000
but taking on us

293
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:22,401
means crossing Governor Ding.

294
00:18:22,641 --> 00:18:25,320
That's a price you can't afford.

295
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:26,520
Master!

296
00:18:28,081 --> 00:18:29,161
Black Tiger,

297
00:18:29,161 --> 00:18:30,161
Ding Chong,

298
00:18:30,841 --> 00:18:32,921
you think either can scare me?

299
00:18:53,601 --> 00:18:54,601
Salt, herbs,

300
00:18:54,760 --> 00:18:55,681
tea, porcelain.

301
00:18:55,921 --> 00:18:56,601
These are

302
00:18:56,601 --> 00:18:58,040
Nethereach's transaction records.

303
00:18:58,681 --> 00:19:00,320
The profit from porcelain alone

304
00:19:00,320 --> 00:19:01,201
nearly matches

305
00:19:01,201 --> 00:19:02,480
Shazhou's annual tax revenue.

306
00:19:07,201 --> 00:19:08,520
The split's clear.

307
00:19:09,361 --> 00:19:11,280
Black Tiger and Ding Chong each get a cut.

308
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:12,800
The third share

309
00:19:12,800 --> 00:19:14,441
is marked only "the garrison."

310
00:19:15,401 --> 00:19:16,081
What?

311
00:19:16,641 --> 00:19:18,000
Too scared to put down the full name?

312
00:19:18,320 --> 00:19:20,201
This bold with the arms trade,

313
00:19:20,201 --> 00:19:21,320
your accomplice

314
00:19:21,320 --> 00:19:22,121
at the garrison

315
00:19:22,121 --> 00:19:24,320
must be pretty high up.

316
00:19:26,201 --> 00:19:27,441
You two think you

317
00:19:27,441 --> 00:19:28,760
can interrogate me?

318
00:19:33,560 --> 00:19:35,000
Are you going to talk or not?

319
00:19:35,441 --> 00:19:37,800
Go find out yourself.

320
00:19:40,921 --> 00:19:42,441
Now that we have the ledger,

321
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:43,201
we can

322
00:19:43,201 --> 00:19:44,841
pin it all on Master Feng.

323
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:47,760
Feng Lu,

324
00:19:48,121 --> 00:19:50,280
illegally charged women registration fees,

325
00:19:50,601 --> 00:19:52,121
ran Nethereach's black market,

326
00:19:52,161 --> 00:19:53,681
sold trade licenses,

327
00:19:54,081 --> 00:19:55,800
extorted protection fees from merchants...

328
00:19:55,800 --> 00:19:57,121
You lying bitch!

329
00:19:57,401 --> 00:19:58,800
I did none of that!

330
00:19:59,240 --> 00:20:00,921
Killing is all I do!

331
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:02,760
Feng Lu colluded with the garrison

332
00:20:02,841 --> 00:20:04,000
to traffic arms.

333
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:05,881
I don't even know

334
00:20:05,881 --> 00:20:06,800
where the garrison is!

335
00:20:06,800 --> 00:20:07,480
It was Wang...

336
00:20:10,881 --> 00:20:11,960
Wang Qi?

337
00:20:12,601 --> 00:20:14,161
Shazhou's military governor.

338
00:20:14,401 --> 00:20:15,401
He's been here for years

339
00:20:15,401 --> 00:20:16,361
and is well respected.

340
00:20:16,401 --> 00:20:17,560
He's been stationed here

341
00:20:17,560 --> 00:20:18,960
since the late emperor's reign

342
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:20,480
and earned real merit on the battlefield

343
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:21,960
with General Gao Meng.

344
00:20:22,641 --> 00:20:24,161
After all these years in Shazhou,

345
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:25,921
with so many men depending

346
00:20:25,921 --> 00:20:26,720
on him,

347
00:20:27,320 --> 00:20:28,760
I bet he's forgotten his duty as a general

348
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:30,480
and put profit above all else.

349
00:20:30,841 --> 00:20:32,800
Seems you see right through

350
00:20:33,081 --> 00:20:34,040
human greed.

351
00:20:34,280 --> 00:20:35,201
So,

352
00:20:35,681 --> 00:20:37,040
Feng was the one

353
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:38,081
who bought Wang Qi off.

354
00:20:38,081 --> 00:20:39,520
I told you, it wasn't me.

355
00:20:39,921 --> 00:20:40,320
Who

356
00:20:40,320 --> 00:20:41,560
turns down money these days?

357
00:20:42,720 --> 00:20:44,280
Arms trafficking is big business.

358
00:20:44,280 --> 00:20:45,760
Who wouldn't want a cut?

359
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:46,681
Wang Qi

360
00:20:48,121 --> 00:20:49,480
and Ding Chong go way back.

361
00:20:49,960 --> 00:20:51,040
When Ding talked him into it,

362
00:20:51,040 --> 00:20:51,720
he said

363
00:20:51,841 --> 00:20:54,401
even the toughest man

364
00:20:56,401 --> 00:20:58,161
crumbles before the lure of gold.

365
00:20:58,560 --> 00:20:59,320
Take a good look.

366
00:20:59,401 --> 00:21:01,201
This is the statement you just gave.

367
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,201
If it's all correct,

368
00:21:03,320 --> 00:21:04,280
sign it and add your thumbprint.

369
00:21:04,280 --> 00:21:05,520
I can't read.

370
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:08,121
I've written your name for you.

371
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:09,280
Here.

372
00:21:11,121 --> 00:21:12,921
Put your thumbprint on it.

373
00:21:21,040 --> 00:21:23,280
Pretty quick and decisive.

374
00:21:23,641 --> 00:21:25,081
Even Ministry of Justice couldn't do better.

375
00:21:25,401 --> 00:21:26,161
Mr. Hal,

376
00:21:27,040 --> 00:21:28,000
we've got the testimony.

377
00:21:28,401 --> 00:21:30,201
Just the ledger left.

378
00:21:31,921 --> 00:21:33,720
Who bought the arms from you?

379
00:21:33,881 --> 00:21:35,161
Where is the real

380
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,280
ledger?

381
00:21:36,280 --> 00:21:37,800
I don't know the buyers.

382
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:40,441
Never seen a ledger either.

383
00:21:40,441 --> 00:21:41,201
Black Tiger

384
00:21:41,201 --> 00:21:42,320
is just the middleman.

385
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:44,520
We take the money

386
00:21:44,841 --> 00:21:45,881
and deliver the goods.

387
00:21:46,201 --> 00:21:47,480
You're about to die,

388
00:21:47,480 --> 00:21:48,800
yet you're still covering for Ding Chong?

389
00:21:49,081 --> 00:21:50,480
Once you get caught,

390
00:21:50,480 --> 00:21:51,921
his first move will be

391
00:21:51,921 --> 00:21:52,921
to get rid of you.

392
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:54,480
When you're dead,

393
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:55,161
he'll slaughter

394
00:21:55,161 --> 00:21:56,720
all your men

395
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:57,280
and find

396
00:21:57,280 --> 00:21:58,800
someone to replace you.

397
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:08,121
Greetings, Governor Ding!

398
00:22:08,480 --> 00:22:09,240
Governor Ding,

399
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:10,361
our Master has been captured.

400
00:22:10,361 --> 00:22:11,760
Please save him.

401
00:22:12,081 --> 00:22:13,401
are all your men here?

402
00:22:13,881 --> 00:22:14,720
Yes.

403
00:22:14,800 --> 00:22:15,401
Good.

404
00:22:15,881 --> 00:22:17,841
We're going in.

405
00:22:18,280 --> 00:22:19,000
Okay.

406
00:22:19,121 --> 00:22:19,960
Guys,

407
00:22:20,121 --> 00:22:21,921
let's go save the Master!

408
00:22:21,921 --> 00:22:22,441
Let's go!

409
00:22:22,441 --> 00:22:23,000
Move!

410
00:22:35,960 --> 00:22:36,681
Master!

411
00:22:39,841 --> 00:22:42,401
Black Tiger has trafficked arms

412
00:22:42,641 --> 00:22:43,841
and committed hideous crimes.

413
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:46,560
Today, I lead the troops

414
00:22:46,560 --> 00:22:47,800
to wipe it out.

415
00:22:47,921 --> 00:22:49,201
Kill them all.

416
00:22:50,960 --> 00:22:51,921
Master,

417
00:22:52,601 --> 00:22:54,000
that bastard Ding Chong

418
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:55,161
brought a small army

419
00:22:55,161 --> 00:22:56,401
down on us.

420
00:22:56,800 --> 00:22:58,280
Our men are either dead

421
00:22:58,280 --> 00:22:59,280
or wounded.

422
00:22:59,280 --> 00:23:00,280
Ding Chong got here

423
00:23:00,280 --> 00:23:01,760
faster than I expected.

424
00:23:03,401 --> 00:23:05,240
My men!

425
00:23:06,361 --> 00:23:09,201
Ding Chong, you son of a bitch!

426
00:23:09,201 --> 00:23:10,841
I'll kill him!

427
00:23:10,841 --> 00:23:12,240
Hand out the real ledger,

428
00:23:12,441 --> 00:23:13,560
and I'll spare your life.

429
00:23:14,201 --> 00:23:15,960
It's under my bed.

430
00:23:17,201 --> 00:23:18,280
Let me go.

431
00:23:30,921 --> 00:23:32,320
At least he has some backbone.

432
00:23:36,040 --> 00:23:37,280
Why is Ding Chong here?

433
00:23:47,720 --> 00:23:48,601
Mr. Shen,

434
00:23:48,601 --> 00:23:50,641
what an honor to have you deliver

435
00:23:50,841 --> 00:23:53,401
Chancellor Xu's instructions in person.

436
00:23:55,641 --> 00:23:56,800
For old times' sake,

437
00:23:57,601 --> 00:23:58,201
His Excellency

438
00:23:58,201 --> 00:24:00,081
sent me to save your life.

439
00:24:00,760 --> 00:24:01,641
I don't get it.

440
00:24:01,800 --> 00:24:03,000
Please, enlighten me.

441
00:24:07,401 --> 00:24:09,401
The court's already sent an envoy to Shazhou

442
00:24:09,881 --> 00:24:12,000
to look into the arms smuggling.

443
00:24:13,280 --> 00:24:15,081
Is that because of Hal...

444
00:24:16,921 --> 00:24:18,040
His Excellency said

445
00:24:18,361 --> 00:24:20,320
if you want to walk away clean,

446
00:24:20,441 --> 00:24:21,121
get rid of

447
00:24:21,121 --> 00:24:22,681
Black Tiger soon.

448
00:24:27,081 --> 00:24:28,081
Then

449
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:29,320
pin everything

450
00:24:29,320 --> 00:24:30,841
on them.

451
00:24:31,441 --> 00:24:32,841
Dead men

452
00:24:33,361 --> 00:24:34,841
tell no tales.

453
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:39,720
His Excellency is wise.

454
00:24:40,641 --> 00:24:42,000
I couldn't

455
00:24:42,161 --> 00:24:43,280
agree more.

456
00:24:44,081 --> 00:24:45,641
I'm on it.

457
00:25:22,800 --> 00:25:24,201
Ding Chong,

458
00:25:39,401 --> 00:25:41,641
your leg was injured three years ago.

459
00:25:42,000 --> 00:25:43,161
If I hadn't

460
00:25:43,361 --> 00:25:45,921
carried you from Qingzhou to Shazhou,

461
00:25:46,520 --> 00:25:48,921
the wolves would've had you.

462
00:25:51,720 --> 00:25:52,601
All these years,

463
00:25:52,601 --> 00:25:55,441
I've treated you like my own brother.

464
00:25:56,280 --> 00:26:00,040
But you killed every man of mine.

465
00:26:00,201 --> 00:26:01,081
Feng,

466
00:26:01,280 --> 00:26:03,280
if we're really brothers, do me a favor.

467
00:26:03,881 --> 00:26:05,000
You die,

468
00:26:05,401 --> 00:26:06,681
I get to live.

469
00:26:06,921 --> 00:26:08,401
Ding Chong!

470
00:26:20,720 --> 00:26:21,841
Surround this place.

471
00:26:22,161 --> 00:26:23,681
No one walks out of here alive.

472
00:26:23,681 --> 00:26:24,161
Yes.

473
00:26:24,161 --> 00:26:25,121
Stop!

474
00:26:28,800 --> 00:26:30,081
Mr. Shen,

475
00:26:30,201 --> 00:26:31,960
Black Tiger's committed countless crimes.

476
00:26:32,040 --> 00:26:34,201
I've already killed their leader, Feng Lu.

477
00:26:35,881 --> 00:26:36,641
Hal?

478
00:26:37,960 --> 00:26:38,560
Hal,

479
00:26:38,560 --> 00:26:39,601
are you hurt?

480
00:26:39,921 --> 00:26:40,601
I'm fine.

481
00:26:41,320 --> 00:26:42,441
Ding Chong,

482
00:26:42,441 --> 00:26:43,361
you're guilty of serious crimes.

483
00:26:43,361 --> 00:26:44,320
Surrender yourself.

484
00:26:44,800 --> 00:26:45,520
Arrest him.

485
00:26:49,081 --> 00:26:49,960
Mr. Shen,

486
00:26:49,960 --> 00:26:50,280
is...

487
00:26:50,280 --> 00:26:51,361
Is there some misunderstanding?

488
00:26:51,361 --> 00:26:52,040
Huang Bo.

489
00:26:54,720 --> 00:26:55,720
Ding Chong,

490
00:26:56,040 --> 00:26:57,520
a sworn official,

491
00:26:57,520 --> 00:26:58,681
you conspired with the Black Tiger

492
00:26:58,681 --> 00:27:00,560
to traffic weapons for your own gain.

493
00:27:00,560 --> 00:27:02,161
You made people suffer and killed the innocent.

494
00:27:02,921 --> 00:27:03,960
Even the death

495
00:27:04,161 --> 00:27:05,121
wouldn't be enough

496
00:27:05,121 --> 00:27:06,401
to atone for your crimes.

497
00:27:06,760 --> 00:27:07,681
Who are you?

498
00:27:08,480 --> 00:27:09,401
I can tell you're

499
00:27:09,800 --> 00:27:10,921
someone of real power.

500
00:27:11,560 --> 00:27:13,081
We're the same kind of people.

501
00:27:13,560 --> 00:27:15,240
Why make trouble for each other?

502
00:27:15,441 --> 00:27:16,361
Tell me

503
00:27:16,560 --> 00:27:17,441
what you want.

504
00:27:17,881 --> 00:27:18,921
Let me go, and I'll give you

505
00:27:19,480 --> 00:27:20,681
ten thousand taels of gold.

506
00:27:20,881 --> 00:27:22,000
The gold

507
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:23,881
couldn't save your sorry life.

508
00:27:23,881 --> 00:27:25,161
Ding Chong is under arrest.

509
00:27:25,560 --> 00:27:26,841
Drop your weapons

510
00:27:27,121 --> 00:27:28,760
before it's too late.

511
00:27:29,040 --> 00:27:30,760
You may still redeem yourselves.

512
00:27:30,841 --> 00:27:32,201
Keep resisting,

513
00:27:32,520 --> 00:27:33,601
and you'll face the same charges.

514
00:27:34,040 --> 00:27:34,960
Drop them!

515
00:27:37,441 --> 00:27:38,480
Take them back

516
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:39,921
for questioning.

517
00:27:40,520 --> 00:27:41,960
Find out where the weapons went.

518
00:27:43,921 --> 00:27:45,320
Mr. Shen! Mr. Shen!

519
00:27:45,401 --> 00:27:46,280
Mr. Shen!

520
00:27:48,760 --> 00:27:49,560
Protect Mr. Hal.

521
00:28:01,921 --> 00:28:02,480
Huang Bo,

522
00:28:02,800 --> 00:28:03,361
after him.

523
00:28:03,361 --> 00:28:03,881
Yes.

524
00:28:09,921 --> 00:28:11,480
A bolt that can penetrate this deeply

525
00:28:11,641 --> 00:28:12,841
must be forged from refined iron.

526
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:14,201
Same material as

527
00:28:14,201 --> 00:28:14,841
the trafficked weapons.

528
00:28:15,560 --> 00:28:17,320
Could they be melting down the weapons

529
00:28:17,320 --> 00:28:18,121
and forging new ones?

530
00:28:18,320 --> 00:28:19,560
That guy who silenced Ding Chong

531
00:28:19,921 --> 00:28:21,201
must be an insider.

532
00:28:21,520 --> 00:28:23,201
The real arms ledger shows

533
00:28:23,201 --> 00:28:24,601
that a large number of weapons

534
00:28:24,601 --> 00:28:25,441
are still unaccounted for.

535
00:28:25,641 --> 00:28:26,601
That man in black

536
00:28:27,121 --> 00:28:28,161
is likely tied

537
00:28:28,161 --> 00:28:29,320
to the buyer.

538
00:28:34,800 --> 00:28:36,881
The pattern on this is unusual.

539
00:28:39,921 --> 00:28:41,441
Find out who that man in black is

540
00:28:41,560 --> 00:28:42,601
and where this crossbow bolt came from.

541
00:28:42,760 --> 00:28:43,720
Mr. Ding!

542
00:28:48,841 --> 00:28:49,520
Mr. Ding!

543
00:28:49,681 --> 00:28:50,520
Take him back.

544
00:28:53,520 --> 00:28:54,361
Bring everyone

545
00:28:54,361 --> 00:28:55,720
- Let me go.
- involved in.

546
00:28:56,240 --> 00:28:56,800
Move.

547
00:28:57,201 --> 00:28:58,240
Mr. Ding!

548
00:28:58,240 --> 00:28:59,040
- Go.
- Move it.

549
00:29:15,921 --> 00:29:16,800
Ding Chong's dead.

550
00:29:17,320 --> 00:29:18,720
You're no longer a fugitive.

551
00:29:19,161 --> 00:29:20,040
I'll have Zhishu

552
00:29:20,040 --> 00:29:21,000
restore your personal records,

553
00:29:21,601 --> 00:29:22,841
and then you can sit the imperial exam.

554
00:29:25,121 --> 00:29:26,601
Then I suppose

555
00:29:26,921 --> 00:29:28,161
we're even.

556
00:29:41,960 --> 00:29:42,401
Run!

557
00:29:42,441 --> 00:29:43,320
The soldiers are here!

558
00:29:46,441 --> 00:29:47,081
Put it down here.

559
00:29:51,520 --> 00:29:52,520
You, hurry up!

560
00:30:03,601 --> 00:30:04,881
Mom, what's happening?

561
00:30:05,040 --> 00:30:06,040
Keep your voice down.

562
00:30:08,201 --> 00:30:09,000
Your uncle's dead.

563
00:30:09,280 --> 00:30:09,960
The soldiers are

564
00:30:09,960 --> 00:30:11,000
rounding people up.

565
00:30:11,320 --> 00:30:12,401
Put these on

566
00:30:12,401 --> 00:30:13,201
and come with me.

567
00:30:14,040 --> 00:30:15,921
These are so ugly.

568
00:30:16,320 --> 00:30:17,320
I won't wear them.

569
00:30:17,520 --> 00:30:18,601
I'd rather die than wear them.

570
00:30:20,520 --> 00:30:22,000
If you wanna live, do as I say.

571
00:30:24,040 --> 00:30:24,641
Put them on.

572
00:30:29,081 --> 00:30:29,841
Quick, quick.

573
00:30:33,040 --> 00:30:34,681
This stinks.

574
00:30:34,681 --> 00:30:36,161
This is no time for that! Get in!

575
00:30:42,760 --> 00:30:43,240
Hurry.

576
00:30:43,881 --> 00:30:44,560
Okay.

577
00:30:44,560 --> 00:30:45,081
Good.

578
00:30:55,040 --> 00:30:55,681
Your Majesty,

579
00:30:55,881 --> 00:30:56,841
military governor Wang Qi

580
00:30:56,841 --> 00:30:57,760
and all the generals of Shazhou's garrison

581
00:30:57,760 --> 00:30:58,560
have been executed.

582
00:30:58,720 --> 00:30:59,841
All evidence in the arms trafficking case

583
00:30:59,841 --> 00:31:00,641
have been sealed and secured.

584
00:31:00,641 --> 00:31:01,760
No word of this is to get out.

585
00:31:02,040 --> 00:31:03,520
Escort it back to Jingdu in secret.

586
00:31:03,921 --> 00:31:04,841
Chancellor Xu

587
00:31:04,841 --> 00:31:06,081
must hear nothing about it.

588
00:31:06,401 --> 00:31:06,921
Yes.

589
00:31:06,921 --> 00:31:07,720
Your Majesty,

590
00:31:07,960 --> 00:31:09,641
Ding Chong and his men are dead.

591
00:31:09,641 --> 00:31:11,441
His estate and his holdings in Nethereach

592
00:31:11,441 --> 00:31:12,320
have all been seized.

593
00:31:12,720 --> 00:31:13,760
Every merchant involved

594
00:31:13,760 --> 00:31:14,881
has been punished by law.

595
00:31:14,881 --> 00:31:15,641
No one got away.

596
00:31:16,401 --> 00:31:18,000
A job well done, Your Majesty.

597
00:31:18,361 --> 00:31:18,881
Your Majesty,

598
00:31:19,161 --> 00:31:20,560
we should head back soon.

599
00:31:20,560 --> 00:31:22,081
We have only three days left

600
00:31:22,201 --> 00:31:23,320
before the Chancellor's deadline.

601
00:31:23,320 --> 00:31:25,081
Are you suggesting I answer to him?

602
00:31:25,240 --> 00:31:26,361
I wouldn't dare.

603
00:31:26,520 --> 00:31:27,641
I listen only to you.

604
00:31:29,641 --> 00:31:30,800
Your Dad is coming here

605
00:31:31,040 --> 00:31:32,720
to oversee the provincial exam.

606
00:31:32,800 --> 00:31:34,081
He should arrive soon.

607
00:31:34,881 --> 00:31:36,201
I still need to discuss

608
00:31:36,441 --> 00:31:38,000
what happened here with him.

609
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:39,681
Then we'll leave that same night

610
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:40,601
and still

611
00:31:40,601 --> 00:31:41,960
make it back in time.

612
00:31:45,480 --> 00:31:46,881
Also, keep a close eye

613
00:31:47,280 --> 00:31:48,641
on Meng Tinghui's results

614
00:31:48,881 --> 00:31:49,921
in the imperial exams for women.

615
00:31:50,720 --> 00:31:52,121
Your Majesty, have you

616
00:31:52,520 --> 00:31:53,601
taken a liking to her?

617
00:31:54,040 --> 00:31:54,960
Yeah.

618
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:59,401
She's cunning,

619
00:31:59,401 --> 00:32:01,240
unpredictable, and shameless.

620
00:32:02,040 --> 00:32:03,081
She's impossible to forget.

621
00:32:03,081 --> 00:32:03,841
Your Majesty,

622
00:32:03,960 --> 00:32:05,401
I get it.

623
00:32:05,841 --> 00:32:07,480
I'll watch that street rogue

624
00:32:07,480 --> 00:32:08,841
closely and make sure

625
00:32:08,960 --> 00:32:10,320
she never gets a post at court.

626
00:32:11,681 --> 00:32:12,441
Huang,

627
00:32:13,161 --> 00:32:13,800
you're getting

628
00:32:13,800 --> 00:32:15,040
better at reading His Majesty's mind.

629
00:32:15,040 --> 00:32:16,480
I've served His Majesty for long.

630
00:32:17,520 --> 00:32:19,240
What I meant was, street smarts

631
00:32:19,520 --> 00:32:20,361
sometimes are

632
00:32:20,361 --> 00:32:21,520
more useful at court than

633
00:32:21,520 --> 00:32:22,361
the lofty teachings.

634
00:32:22,361 --> 00:32:23,720
His Majesty said he has his eye on her.

635
00:32:23,921 --> 00:32:24,881
How do you still not get it?

636
00:32:25,361 --> 00:32:26,081
Huang Bo,

637
00:32:26,401 --> 00:32:27,841
do you remember this place?

638
00:32:28,401 --> 00:32:29,960
Ten years ago, a severe drought struck here

639
00:32:30,161 --> 00:32:31,161
and sandstorms ravaged the land.

640
00:32:31,520 --> 00:32:32,480
To hold the sand back,

641
00:32:32,681 --> 00:32:34,361
Your Majesty led men to plant these poplars.

642
00:32:34,720 --> 00:32:36,361
Now the sandstorms have receded.

643
00:32:36,720 --> 00:32:37,921
Every visit to Shazhou

644
00:32:38,361 --> 00:32:39,201
brings greater

645
00:32:39,201 --> 00:32:40,841
danger than the last.

646
00:32:41,520 --> 00:32:42,601
Do you remember

647
00:32:43,000 --> 00:32:44,760
that little girl who stole my jade pendant?

648
00:33:00,280 --> 00:33:00,921
I do.

649
00:33:01,560 --> 00:33:02,841
She was forced.

650
00:33:03,601 --> 00:33:04,361
Because of her,

651
00:33:04,841 --> 00:33:05,921
Your Majesty brought down

652
00:33:05,921 --> 00:33:07,641
the child-trafficking ring in Shazhou.

653
00:33:42,560 --> 00:33:43,681
Xiang, eat it up.

654
00:33:54,401 --> 00:33:55,121
Let's go.

655
00:33:55,601 --> 00:33:56,320
Where are we going?

656
00:33:56,681 --> 00:33:57,641
Bofeng House.

657
00:33:58,081 --> 00:33:58,800
I heard it

658
00:33:58,800 --> 00:34:00,201
just opened in Shazhou.

659
00:34:00,361 --> 00:34:01,240
And Shazhou mutton noodles

660
00:34:01,240 --> 00:34:02,201
taste amazing.

661
00:34:02,441 --> 00:34:03,520
I fasted for you every day

662
00:34:03,520 --> 00:34:04,361
at the Sacred Ancestral Hall,

663
00:34:04,361 --> 00:34:05,480
traveled all the way here,

664
00:34:05,480 --> 00:34:06,960
and haven't had a single proper meal.

665
00:34:07,201 --> 00:34:08,040
I've gotten so thin.

666
00:34:08,161 --> 00:34:09,841
You don't look any thinner to me.

667
00:34:25,681 --> 00:34:26,400
Sir,

668
00:34:26,760 --> 00:34:28,081
Ding Chong and Feng Lu are dead.

669
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:30,201
Those greedy lapdogs of the Great Ning

670
00:34:30,201 --> 00:34:31,320
are useless now.

671
00:34:31,521 --> 00:34:32,561
No great loss.

672
00:34:32,641 --> 00:34:33,400
Sir,

673
00:34:33,920 --> 00:34:34,440
we've bought

674
00:34:34,440 --> 00:34:35,601
some weapons over the years,

675
00:34:35,681 --> 00:34:37,041
but not nearly enough.

676
00:34:37,481 --> 00:34:38,920
Now that this source is gone,

677
00:34:39,320 --> 00:34:40,880
we'll have to find another.

678
00:34:41,161 --> 00:34:43,481
Priority now is covering our tracks.

679
00:34:43,961 --> 00:34:45,320
We need to keep

680
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:46,360
our identities hidden.

681
00:34:46,521 --> 00:34:47,201
Yes.

682
00:34:48,240 --> 00:34:50,121
The Great Ning's days

683
00:34:50,720 --> 00:34:51,641
are numbered.

684
00:35:15,121 --> 00:35:16,121
Fire!

685
00:35:16,481 --> 00:35:17,161
Someone!

686
00:35:17,400 --> 00:35:18,121
Help!

687
00:35:18,440 --> 00:35:19,521
Tinghui, it's me.

688
00:35:22,201 --> 00:35:22,920
Fuzhi,

689
00:35:23,041 --> 00:35:24,320
what are you doing?

690
00:35:24,561 --> 00:35:25,240
We've had

691
00:35:25,240 --> 00:35:26,360
nothing but bad luck lately.

692
00:35:26,360 --> 00:35:27,561
I'm getting rid of it for you.

693
00:35:28,320 --> 00:35:29,201
Getting rid of bad luck?

694
00:35:30,280 --> 00:35:30,920
Tinghui,

695
00:35:30,920 --> 00:35:31,880
you're incredible.

696
00:35:32,121 --> 00:35:32,800
Brighter days

697
00:35:32,800 --> 00:35:34,320
are finally ahead for Shazhou.

698
00:35:34,601 --> 00:35:36,121
Can't believe Jiang Mei'er

699
00:35:36,121 --> 00:35:37,320
just vanished.

700
00:35:37,320 --> 00:35:37,961
She got off too easily.

701
00:35:38,561 --> 00:35:39,800
She'll get what's coming to her.

702
00:35:40,201 --> 00:35:40,800
Fuzhi,

703
00:35:42,121 --> 00:35:43,161
could you move this brazier first?

704
00:35:43,161 --> 00:35:44,001
I've got more

705
00:35:44,001 --> 00:35:44,800
good news.

706
00:35:44,961 --> 00:35:46,720
Bofeng House's finally mine.

707
00:35:46,720 --> 00:35:47,920
Business is booming.

708
00:35:47,920 --> 00:35:48,681
Xi'er and Haitang

709
00:35:48,681 --> 00:35:49,561
can barely keep up.

710
00:35:49,561 --> 00:35:50,201
My Dad

711
00:35:50,201 --> 00:35:51,121
called off that awful engagement

712
00:35:51,121 --> 00:35:51,681
too.

713
00:35:51,681 --> 00:35:52,440
You should've seen

714
00:35:52,440 --> 00:35:53,760
my stepmother's face.

715
00:35:53,961 --> 00:35:54,360
She looked like

716
00:35:54,360 --> 00:35:55,880
she'd swallowed a hundred flies.

717
00:35:58,041 --> 00:35:59,561
I'll head back to Bofeng House with you

718
00:35:59,561 --> 00:36:00,521
and wait for Mr. Hal there.

719
00:36:01,201 --> 00:36:02,601
He has my entry writ.

720
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:03,720
I can't rest easy

721
00:36:03,720 --> 00:36:04,760
until I've got it back.

722
00:36:04,961 --> 00:36:05,920
Right.

723
00:36:05,920 --> 00:36:06,681
Take it away.

724
00:36:07,440 --> 00:36:08,400
No way.

725
00:36:08,800 --> 00:36:09,880
Rid the bad luck first.

726
00:36:12,920 --> 00:36:13,481
Here.

727
00:36:13,561 --> 00:36:14,320
Left hand.

728
00:36:15,201 --> 00:36:15,961
Right hand.

729
00:36:16,561 --> 00:36:17,201
Left leg.

730
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:18,481
Turn around.

731
00:36:20,481 --> 00:36:21,521
Fuzhi!

732
00:36:55,081 --> 00:36:55,920
Where's my file?

733
00:37:06,121 --> 00:37:07,681
At least buy me a meal first.

734
00:37:27,161 --> 00:37:29,320
Sip the mutton noodle soup first.

735
00:37:29,561 --> 00:37:30,681
It warms the stomach

736
00:37:30,961 --> 00:37:32,320
and wakes up the appetite.

737
00:37:37,681 --> 00:37:38,360
Okay.

738
00:37:39,400 --> 00:37:40,320
I'll try it.

739
00:38:18,800 --> 00:38:20,041
I've been here before,

740
00:38:20,240 --> 00:38:21,840
but I never ate food this good.

741
00:38:22,320 --> 00:38:23,280
Try this.

742
00:38:23,920 --> 00:38:24,961
It's a local specialty.

743
00:38:26,121 --> 00:38:27,800
You've been here before?

744
00:38:30,920 --> 00:38:32,240
My last trip here

745
00:38:32,641 --> 00:38:33,840
was too rushed.

746
00:38:34,641 --> 00:38:35,800
Despite the rocky start,

747
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:37,081
we're friends now.

748
00:38:37,440 --> 00:38:38,521
I brought your file here.

749
00:38:38,521 --> 00:38:40,081
And all I get is one bowl of noodles?

750
00:38:40,681 --> 00:38:42,201
I'm leaving in a couple of days.

751
00:38:42,601 --> 00:38:43,481
Would you

752
00:38:43,800 --> 00:38:45,440
show me around before I go?

753
00:38:46,800 --> 00:38:48,161
The provincial exam's almost here.

754
00:38:48,440 --> 00:38:49,681
My time's precious.

755
00:38:51,001 --> 00:38:52,121
I need to study.

756
00:38:52,440 --> 00:38:53,440
Without your file,

757
00:38:54,161 --> 00:38:54,961
how can you...

758
00:39:04,720 --> 00:39:06,440
You really have a gift for stealing.

759
00:39:08,760 --> 00:39:09,521
Where do you wanna go?

760
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:12,360
Can you ride?

761
00:39:34,041 --> 00:39:36,320
You're an excellent rider.

762
00:39:36,920 --> 00:39:39,001
The desert's so vast. Riding out here

763
00:39:39,081 --> 00:39:40,400
feels so free.

764
00:39:41,161 --> 00:39:42,240
You're brave, resourceful,

765
00:39:42,760 --> 00:39:43,280
and know

766
00:39:43,280 --> 00:39:44,400
how to survive almost anything.

767
00:39:44,840 --> 00:39:45,800
I can't help wondering

768
00:39:46,561 --> 00:39:47,961
what your childhood was like.

769
00:39:54,920 --> 00:39:56,320
I was orphaned

770
00:39:57,840 --> 00:39:59,240
and was abducted by traffickers.

771
00:40:00,041 --> 00:40:01,920
They taught me to steal and con people

772
00:40:02,521 --> 00:40:03,681
to make money for them.

773
00:40:04,880 --> 00:40:06,840
What you call courage and resourcefulness

774
00:40:07,641 --> 00:40:09,081
was simply how I stayed alive.

775
00:40:11,681 --> 00:40:12,561
At best,

776
00:40:13,161 --> 00:40:14,240
you were beaten.

777
00:40:15,681 --> 00:40:16,280
At worst,

778
00:40:17,481 --> 00:40:18,561
you didn't make it.

779
00:40:43,360 --> 00:40:44,561
Brat,

780
00:40:44,961 --> 00:40:46,641
you dare kill me?

781
00:40:58,121 --> 00:40:59,001
Xiang,

782
00:40:59,001 --> 00:40:59,641
run!

783
00:41:05,360 --> 00:41:07,720
Ms. Meng, something on your mind?

784
00:41:13,360 --> 00:41:14,521
Just old memories.

785
00:41:16,961 --> 00:41:19,720
Shazhou is bathed in sunlight,

786
00:41:20,880 --> 00:41:22,041
but beneath the surface, darkness reigns.

787
00:41:23,601 --> 00:41:24,880
Yet officials turn a blind eye.

788
00:41:25,521 --> 00:41:26,760
I want to sit the exams,

789
00:41:27,280 --> 00:41:28,481
not just to protect myself,

790
00:41:29,081 --> 00:41:30,201
but to hold real power.

791
00:41:31,081 --> 00:41:31,800
So villains

792
00:41:31,800 --> 00:41:33,681
can never prey on ordinary people.

793
00:41:35,041 --> 00:41:36,400
If that's your ambition,

794
00:41:37,760 --> 00:41:39,161
I might have a shortcut.

795
00:41:39,240 --> 00:41:40,561
My uncle, Grand Tutor Shen,

796
00:41:40,840 --> 00:41:42,800
will oversee the provincial exam in Shazhou.

797
00:41:43,201 --> 00:41:44,240
Why not let Zhishu

798
00:41:44,240 --> 00:41:45,720
put in a word for you?

799
00:41:46,240 --> 00:41:47,360
Grand Tutor Shen

800
00:41:47,360 --> 00:41:49,320
is known to be upright.

801
00:41:50,681 --> 00:41:52,880
Why does your offer

802
00:41:54,041 --> 00:41:55,360
to help

803
00:41:55,961 --> 00:41:57,400
sound more like a trap?

804
00:41:58,720 --> 00:41:59,601
Set you up?

805
00:41:59,601 --> 00:42:01,121
You're the expert at that.

806
00:42:02,360 --> 00:42:03,201
But you

807
00:42:03,521 --> 00:42:04,481
helped me bring down

808
00:42:04,760 --> 00:42:06,280
those corrupt officials

809
00:42:07,121 --> 00:42:08,201
and their criminal allies.

810
00:42:08,481 --> 00:42:09,800
I only want to repay you.

811
00:42:11,481 --> 00:42:12,481
Look at that tree.

812
00:42:12,720 --> 00:42:13,320
By taking root

813
00:42:13,320 --> 00:42:14,840
on the dune,

814
00:42:15,201 --> 00:42:16,561
it has grown far taller

815
00:42:16,760 --> 00:42:18,081
than those poplar trees.

816
00:42:19,280 --> 00:42:20,601
Sometimes the best approach is to

817
00:42:21,320 --> 00:42:22,961
use circumstances to your advantage.

818
00:42:24,360 --> 00:42:26,280
In the desert, survival

819
00:42:26,720 --> 00:42:28,161
isn't about height.

820
00:42:28,601 --> 00:42:30,440
It's about how deep roots go.

821
00:42:31,720 --> 00:42:33,240
I know where I stand.

822
00:42:33,681 --> 00:42:34,840
Having a friend

823
00:42:34,961 --> 00:42:35,880
like you in Jingdu

824
00:42:35,880 --> 00:42:36,800
would certainly

825
00:42:36,800 --> 00:42:38,440
give me an advantage,

826
00:42:39,320 --> 00:42:40,880
but I still want to make it on my own.

827
00:42:41,481 --> 00:42:42,641
Then I hope you get

828
00:42:44,081 --> 00:42:45,320
everything you wish for.

829
00:42:50,561 --> 00:42:51,641
Here, your jade pendant.

830
00:42:52,521 --> 00:42:53,840
Keep it. Consider it my thanks

831
00:42:54,201 --> 00:42:55,521
for helping me crack the case.

832
00:42:57,760 --> 00:42:58,320
We're

833
00:42:58,320 --> 00:42:59,961
finally even.

834
00:43:00,920 --> 00:43:02,240
I don't wanna owe you anything.

835
00:43:10,961 --> 00:43:11,681
Ms. Meng,

836
00:43:13,961 --> 00:43:14,800
see you around.

837
00:43:15,961 --> 00:43:16,760
Until

838
00:43:17,760 --> 00:43:18,880
our paths cross.
